              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"message\": \"Suggest a quick warm-up before leg day\"\n}"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "REST fallback for the primary Socket.io '/chat' namespace transport. See README section 9.1 for the Socket.io event contract (room:join, message:send, typing, message:seen, etc.)."
